{"id":"n5-098","title":"～どう 言いますか。","romaji":"〜dou iimasu ka.","jlptLevel":5,"shortExplanation":"Asking for the way to say something; 'how do you say'.","longExplanation":"The ～どう言いますか grammar point is used to ask someone how to express something in a particular language or the appropriate way to say it. It can be translated as 'how do you say' in English.","formation":"Word/Phrase + は [language]でどう言いますか / Word/Phrase + をどう言いますか","examples":[{"jp":"「ありがとう」は英語でどう言いますか。","romaji":"「Arigatou」wa eigo de dou iimasu ka.","en":"How do you say 'thank you' in English?","words":[{"surface":"「","vocabId":null},{"surface":"ありがとう","vocabId":null},{"surface":"」","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"英語","vocabId":"1174420","reading":"えいご"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"言い","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,5,6,7,8,9]},{"jp":"この言葉を日本語でどう言いますか。","romaji":"Kono kotoba wo nihongo de dou iimasu ka.","en":"How do you say this word in Japanese?","words":[{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"言葉","vocabId":"1264540","reading":"ことば"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"日本語","vocabId":"1464530","reading":"にほんご"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabId":"1451730","reading":"どう"},{"surface":"言い","vocabId":"1587040","reading":"いう","baseForm":"言う"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5,6,7,8]},{"jp":"「すみません」はフランス語でどう言いますか。","romaji":"「Sumimasen」wa furansugo de dou iimasu ka.","en":"How do you say 'excuse me' in French?","words":[{"surface":"「","vocabId":null},{"surface":"すみません","vocabId":null},{"surface":"」","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"フランス語","vocabId":"1111590","reading":"フランスご"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"どう","vocabI